Package: ontologyMCP
Title: Model Context Protocol Server for Ontology-Based R Packages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Cathal", "Byrne", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cathal@example.com")
Description: Implements an MCP server that exposes ontology object types,
    object set queries, link traversal, concept evaluation, and action
    submission as MCP tools. Enables any MCP-compatible LLM agent to
    interact with your ontology data without writing R code.
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    ontologySpecR,
    objectSetsR,
    actionTypesR,
    jsonlite,
    rlang,
    cli,
    later,
    promises
Suggests:
    conceptR,
    auditR,
    duckdb,
    httpuv,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
